{"type": "message", "id": "81e1199d", "parentId": "90df9b34", "timestamp": "2026-10-11T07:48:42.205Z", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "[Sun 2026-10-11 15:48 GMT+8] Please answer the following legal multiple-choice question. Write your answer to `answer.txt` in the workspace.\n\n**IMPORTANT**: `answer.txt` should contain ONLY the option letter(s) (e.g., `A`, `BC`, `ABCD`). Do not include any explanations, numbering, or extra text.\n\n**Question**:\n下列情形中，违反公证员职业道德，依照《公证员惩戒规则(试行)》，应当受到惩处的有\nA: 公证员甲无正当理由，不接受某体育福利彩票中心对公证事项的委托, \nB: 乙在公证员名片上印有曾经担任过的行政职务、专业技术职务, \nC: 丙在2005年给当事人做的一次公证业务中，因个人的过失而出现错误, \nD: 丁为其哥嫂之间的婚前财产协议办理了公证，并按照规定收取了公证费用\n\n**Note**: You may use available tools or skills in the system to complete this task, and you need to complete the task in 480s."}], "timestamp": 1791704922204}}
{"type": "message", "id": "a4e74675", "parentId": "81e1199d", "timestamp": "2026-10-11T07:49:44.590Z", "message": {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "Let me think about this legal question about notary professional ethics (公证员职业道德) under 《公证员惩戒规则(试行)》 (Notary Disciplinary Rules - Trial).\n\nLet me analyze each option:\n\nA: 公证员甲无正当理由，不接受某体育福利彩票中心对公证事项的委托 — A notary refuses without justified reason to accept a commission for notarization from a sports welfare lottery center. Is this a violation? Under notary rules, notaries generally have an obligation to accept notarization requests unless there's a legitimate reason to refuse (e.g., the matter is illegal, not within their jurisdiction, etc.). Refusing without justified reason to accept a notarization commission — this could be a violation of duty. Actually, per《公证法》 and notary practice rules, 公证员 must accept applications... Actually, there's an obligation to accept. Hmm, but let me think about the specific 惩戒规则.\n\nActually, I recall that under公证员职业道德 and执业行为, refusing to accept without justification is a violation (\"无正当理由拒绝接受公证事项的委托\"). This seems like a correct answer.\n\nB: 乙在公证员名片上印有曾经担任过的行政职务、专业技术职务 — Printing former administrative and professional technical titles on business cards. This is prohibited — notary business cards cannot show things that would mislead or boast. Actually the公证员职业道德/执业纪律 says: 公证员不得在名片上印有…… Actually I recall rules: \"公证员不得利用新闻媒体或其他手段炫耀自己，招揽业务，贬低他人\" and business card restrictions. Yes, printing former administrative/professional titles on business cards is a violation.\n\nC: 丙在2005年给当事人做的一次公证业务中，因个人的过失而出现错误 — one error due to personal fault in 2005. The 惩戒规则(试行) was issued in 2004 (actually 《公证员惩戒规则(试行)》 by中国公证协会, 2004年?). Hmm. Actually there might be a 追诉时效 (limitation period) issue. The question mentions 2005 specifically. Hmm, if the rule took effect after 2005... Actually let me think. 《公证员惩戒规则(试行)》 was adopted2003年12月? Or 2004? Let me recall: 中华全国律师协会 has 律师执业行为规范... For notaries: 《公证员职业道德基本准则》(2002), 《公证员惩戒规则(试行)》 issued by 中国公证协会 in 2004年?Hmm, but the trick might be that C is a single occurrence of error due to negligence — and the rules require \"故意或重大过失\"? Or maybe the point is that 追责时效 is 2 years? Actually there might be a rule: 惩戒的追诉时效...Hmm, another thought: The question is from a law exam (司法考试/法考). Let me think about the standard answer. This looks like it's testing knowledge of 《公证员惩戒规则(试行)》 (中国公证协会 2004年2月? Actually 2004年11月?). Hmm.\n\nActually, I recall the 公证员惩戒规则(试行) was passed on 2004年12月... Let me think about the answer choices more.\n\nD: 丁为其哥嫂之间的婚前财产协议办理了公证，并按照规定收取了公证费用 — Notarizing a prenuptial property agreement between his brother and sister-in-law, and collecting fees. The issue: 公证员 is prohibited from handling notarization matters for relatives? Actually, the relevant rule: \"公证员不得为本人及近亲属办理公证或者办理与本人及近亲属有利害关系的公证\" (公证法第23条第1款第(三)项? Actually 《公证法》第二十三条: 公证员不得有下列行为: ... (三)为本人及近亲属办理公证或者办理与本人及近亲属有利害关系的公证; ... (六)其他违反法律、法规、职业道德的行为).哥嫂 (brother and sister-in-law) — is 哥嫂 considered 近亲属? 近亲属 under 民法 includes配偶、父母、子女、兄弟姐妹、祖父母、外祖父母、孙子女、外孙子女. So 兄弟 (brother) is a 近亲属. But 嫂 (sister-in-law) is not a 近亲属 per se. However, the provision says \"为本人及近亲属办理公证或者办理与本人及近亲属有利害关系的公证\" — the brother is a party (哥嫂之间的婚前财产协议 — parties are the brother and sister-in-law), so the brother IS a party and is a 近亲属. So this is prohibited — notary should not notarize for his own brother. Therefore D is a violation.\n\nBut wait — \"并按照规定收取了公证费用\" — this is a red herring? Or does it make it worse (亲属间办理公证并收费)? Actually the fact of collecting fees doesn't cure the violation. So D is a violation.\n\nHmm, but wait. Actually let me reconsider: is 哥 (elder brother) a 近亲属? Yes, 兄弟姐妹 are 近亲属. So D violates.\n\nC: The 2005 date and \"因个人的过失而出现错误\" — one instance of error due to negligence. Under 惩戒规则, is there a provision about 追诉时效? Let me recall: 《公证员惩戒规则(试行)》 might have: \"对公证员的惩戒，应当在违纪行为发生后两年内提出\" or similar? Hmm. Actually I don't recall a limitation in the notary disciplinary rules. But 律师执业行为规范... hmm.\n\nActually, wait. Let me reconsider. The 《公证员惩戒规则(试行)》 — I believe it's from 中国公证协会, effective 2004年? If the rules took effect after 2005 (e.g., 2006), then conduct in 2005 wouldn't be punishable (法不溯及既往). Hmm, but the question is from an exam presumably around 2006-2008.\n\nActually, let me search: 《公证员惩戒规则(试行)》 于2003年12月30日? Hmm. Let me just do a web search to be sure.\n\nActually, I recall: 中国公证协会 (formerly 中华全国公证员协会) 制定《公证员惩戒规则（试行）》，2004年? The rules were issued around 2004. Hmm.\n\nActually, maybe the trick in C is different: \"因个人的过失而出现错误\" — the惩戒 rules distinguish between 故意 and过失. A one-time error due to negligence might warrant惩戒 only if 造成后果 (caused consequences). The wording \"因个人的过失而出现错误\" without mention of consequences... Hmm, but \"出现错误\" itself might be enough for some lighter discipline (警告/通报批评?).\n\nAlternatively, the trick could be:惩戒规则(试行) doesn't apply retroactively to 2005 if it was enacted later... but if the exam is from 2005-ish...\n\nLet me search the web for this question — it's likely from法考/司法考试 question banks.\n\nLet me think about the question structure: \"下列情形中，违反公证员职业道德，依照《公证员惩戒规则(试行)》，应当受到惩处的有\" — plural answer likely.\n\nLet me research the 公证员惩戒规则(试行) content. Key provisions I remember (or can guess):\n- 公证员不得无正当理由拒绝受理公证 (or 拒绝办理)\n- 公证员名片不得印有行政职务等 (this is from 公证员职业道德基本准则 or 公证执业行为规范? Actually I recall 《公证员职业道德基本准则》第... or 《公证程序规则》?)\n\nHmm, actually regarding business cards: 《公证员职业道德基本准则》(2002年司法部?) — hmm. Let me recall: 司法部《公证员职业道德基本准则》(2002). There's a provision: \"公证员应当注重仪表，文明执业\"? And \"公证员不得以贬低其他公证机构或公证员的方式争揽业务\". Business card: I recall from 《公证执业行为规范》? Not sure.\n\nHmm, actually the exam question may be from the 2007司法考试? Let me search.\n\nActually, I think this is a known question from司法考试 (maybe 2006 or 2007). Let me web search.\n\nPlan: search web for the question text. Then verify the惩戒规则 provisions. Then write answer.txt.\n\nLet me do the search now.", "thinkingSignature": "reasoning_content"}, {"type": "toolCall", "id": "call_450f0ccfd93a4570894079e3", "name": "web_search", "arguments": {"query": "违反公证员职业道德 依照《公证员惩戒规则(试行)》 应当受到惩处 公证员名片 行政职务"}}, {"type": "toolCall", "id": "call_a4c3d05c662341078142d7f9", "name": "web_search", "arguments": {"query": "《公证员惩戒规则(试行)》 全文 惩戒 行为 名片 委托"}}], "api": "openai-completions", "provider": "xiaomi-tp", "model": "mimo-v2.6-pro", "usage": {"input": 259, "output": 4027, "cacheRead": 16256, "cacheWrite": 0, "totalTokens": 20542, "cost": {"input": 0, "output": 0, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0}}, "stopReason": "toolUse", "timestamp": 1791704922205, "responseId": "e0d8d0ff-39de-43a2-baf2-98289cbdfaed_6a851759ba0d4a6398cdc397d3e41819"}}
{"type": "message", "id": "49541543", "parentId": "a4e74675", "timestamp": "2026-10-11T07:49:49.625Z", "message": {"role": "toolResult", "toolCallId": "call_450f0ccfd93a4570894079e3", "toolName": "web_search", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\n  \"query\": \"违反公证员职业道德 依照《公证员惩戒规则(试行)》 应当受到惩处 公证员名片 行政职务\",\n  \"provider\": \"brave\",\n  \"count\": 5,\n  \"tookMs\": 5031,\n  \"externalContent\": {\n    \"untrusted\": true,\n    \"source\": \"web_search\",\n    \"provider\": \"brave\",\n    \"wrapped\": true\n  },\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"94dc093f5b4ff1b2\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n公证员惩戒的种类和适用条件 - 遗产继承律师\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"94dc093f5b4ff1b2\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"http://www.govwq.com/show-m.asp?id=4015\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"e89625217d84d634\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n1．《公证员惩戒规则(试行)》第12条规定，公证员有下列行为之一的，予以警告：(1)无正当理由，不接受指定的公益性公证事项的；(2)无正当理由，不按期出具公证书的；(3)在媒体上或者利用其他手段提供虚假信息，对本公证机构或者本公证机构的公证员进行夸大、虚假宣传，误导当事人、公众或者社会舆论的；(4)违反规定减免公证收费的；(5)在公证员名片上印有曾担任过的行政职务、荣誉职务、专业技术职务或者其他头衔的；(6)采用不正当方式垄断公\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"e89625217d84d634\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.govwq.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"12b4a17a71852669\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n公证员惩戒规则（试行）_广东省广州市海珠公证处\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"12b4a17a71852669\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"http://www.hzgzc.com/sfjs/18\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"6a7f212a0a28445f\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n第一条 为了切实履行公证员协会的职责，发挥行业自律的作用，规范对公证员的惩戒工作，维护公证行业执业秩序，根据《中华人民共和国公证暂行条例》、《关于深化公证工作改革的方案》和《中国公证员协会章程》的有关规定，制定本规则。 第二条 依法取得中华人民共和国公证员执业证书的公证员，违反法律、法规、规章、执业纪律和职业道德的，应根据本规则给予惩戒。 第三条 对公证员的惩戒必须以事实为根据，以法律为准绳，坚持惩戒与教育相结合，遵循客观、公正、公开的原则。 第四条 公证机构和公证员有义务执行惩戒委员会作出的惩戒决定。\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"6a7f212a0a28445f\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"May 16, 2015\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.hzgzc.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"5123103d614c741f\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n司法考试卷一《司法制度》复习知识点4 --司法考试频道--中国教育在线\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"5123103d614c741f\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.eol.cn/hang_kao/si_fa/sifaquanjiexi/juanyi/zhidao/201708/t20170830_1550768.shtml\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"3c8affc9e264b58c\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n1.《公证员惩戒规则(试行)》第12条规定，公证员有下列行为之一的，予以警告：(1)无正当理由，不接受指定的公益性公证事项的;(2)无正当理由，不按期出具公证书的;(3)在媒体上或者利用其他手段提供虚假信息，对本公证机构或者本公证机构的公证员进行夸大、虚假宣传，误导当事人、公众或者社会舆论的;(4)违反规定减免公证收费的;(5)在公证员名片上印有曾担任过的行政职务、荣誉职务、专业技术职务或者其他头衔的;(6)采用不正当方式垄断公证业务的\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"3c8affc9e264b58c\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.eol.cn\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"096c825f8034ccf0\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n公证执业违规行为惩戒规则（试行）_规范性文件_公证业务_北京市公证协会官方网站\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"096c825f8034ccf0\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.chinabjnotary.org.cn/content/details_17_67059.html\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"4002aa2ffce00252\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n北京市公证协会开展2026年第二期公证员职前培训面试考核\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"4002aa2ffce00252\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.chinabjnotary.org.cn\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"18a013d9ddc12c8b\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n中国公证人职业道德规范 - 上海中法公证法律交流培训中心\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"18a013d9ddc12c8b\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"http://www.cnfr-notaire.org/Article.List5.asp?id=1132\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"d4707d1c854cbce4\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n中国公证人职业道德规范[1] · 中国公证协会副秘书长\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"d4707d1c854cbce4\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.cnfr-notaire.or