{"type": "message", "id": "5cf42716", "parentId": "20c726ec", "timestamp": "2026-10-11T07:54:35.320Z", "message": {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "The exact question doesn't seem readily indexed. Let me reason it out from the rules text carefully.\n\nThe question: \"下列情形中，违反公证员职业道德，依照《公证员惩戒规则(试行)》，应当受到惩处的有\"\n\nA: 公证员甲无正当理由，不接受某体育福利彩票中心对公证事项的委托\nB: 乙在公证员名片上印有曾经担任过的行政职务、专业技术职务\nC: 丙在2005年给当事人做的一次公证业务中，因个人的过失而出现错误\nD: 丁为其哥嫂之间的婚前财产协议办理了公证，并按照规定收取了公证费用\n\nLet me now think about the intended test points:\n\nA → 12(1): 无正当理由，不接受指定的公益性公证事项的 → 警告. 体育福利彩票开奖公证 is公益性. The question says \"委托\" — but the intent: lottery notarization is a public-interest matter. Most textbook analyses: 彩票开奖公证属于公益性公证事项，公证员无正当理由不得拒绝. → Punishable. I'll include A.\n\nHmm, but wait — \"不接受某体育福利彩票中心对公证事项的委托\" — the rule requires \"指定的\" (designated). A 委托 from a lottery center is a contract of entrustment, not a designation. Hmm. But also13(2): \"对应当受理的公证事项，无故推诿不予受理的\" → 严重警告. If the matter应当受理 (should be accepted), refusing without cause = punishable. A福利彩票开奖公证 is a matter that应当受理? Hmm.\n\nActually, let me think about the pedagogy of this question. It seems designed so that each option maps to a specific rule item:\n- A → 12(1) (warning for refusing designated public-interest notarization)\n- B → 12(5) (warning for business card)\n- C → 13(9)? or non-punishable\n- D → 13(6) (violation of recusal) or non-punishable\n\nIf the answer were ABCD, the question would be trivial-ish. Typically such multi-select questions have 2-3 correct.\n\nNow C: \"在2005年给当事人做的一次公证业务中，因个人的过失而出现错误\" — hmm, one error in one notarization. Under 13(9): \"一年内连续出现2件以内错误公证文书的\" → 严重警告. So one erroneous document within a year is punishable. So C seems punishable...\n\nBUT: \"因个人的过失而出现错误\" — does an error in a notarization business necessarily equal an \"错误公证文书\"? Yes, if he made an error in the notarization, the resulting公证书 is erroneous.\n\nHmm wait, but maybe there's a subtlety with \"2005年\": Perhaps the exam was given in 2009 or 2010, and the point is that the惩戒规则 has a追诉时效? Let me check whether other rules have such a provision... The《公证员惩戒规则(试行)》 full text has no limitation period. Hmm.\n\nOR — the \"2005\" detail is about the rule's effective date: 本规则自2004年4月1日起施行. Conduct in 2005 is after effectiveness → punishable. If the question said \"2003年\", it wouldn't be punishable. So \"2005\" confirms coverage. Thus C is punishable.\n\nHmm, but hold on. Let me reconsider: maybe the question intends C as NOT punishable because \"因个人的过失而出现错误\" — one instance — and under 第25条(二), \"情节显著轻微的，予以批评教育，不作惩戒处理\". Hmm, but 13(9) explicitly lists \"一年内连续出现2件以内错误公证文书\" as warranting严重警告, so a single error is not \"情节显著轻微\".\n\nHmm, hmm. Actually, wait. Let me reconsider 13(9) wording: \"一年内连续出现2件以内错误公证文书的\" — hmm, this phrasing \"连续出现2件以内\" is strange. Maybe it's a typo in the source for \"2件以上\"? Let me verify with another independent source of the full text. The eol.cn article lists it as \"一年内连续出现2件以内错误公证文书的\" too. And 14(1) is \"一年内连续出现3件以上5件以下错误公证文书的\". So 13(9) covers 1-2件. OK.\n\nSo a single erroneous document → 严重警告. C is punishable.\n\nD: 丁为其哥嫂之间的婚前财产协议办理了公证，并按照规定收取了公证费用.\n-回避:公证员的哥哥是当事人 →应回避 → 13(6) 违反回避规定的 → 严重警告. Punishable.\n\nHmm wait, but actually — is 回避 required? Under《公证程序规则》(2002年6月18日司法部令第72号)第十条: \"公证人员有下列情形之一的，应当自行回避...(一)是本公证事项的当事人或者当事近亲属的;(二)与本公证事项有利害关系的;...\" And \"当事人也可以申请回避\". Also《公证法》第23条第(三)项(2006): \"为本人及近亲属办理公证或者办理与本人及近亲属有利害关系的公证\" is prohibited. In 2004-era rules, 公证暂行条例 + 公证程序规则 required回避.\n\n哥嫂之间的婚前财产协议 — parties: 哥, 嫂. 公证员丁's 兄长 is a party → 丁 is a近亲属 of the party → must recuse. So D violates回避 → punishable.\n\nThe \"按照规定收取了公证费用\" bit is a red herring (no fee violation), but the回避 violation stands.\n\nHmm, but wait — could the exam consider哥嫂 not within 近亲属? 近亲属 per民法通则/民诉法: 配偶、父母、子女、兄弟姐妹、祖父母、外祖父母、孙子女、外孙子女. 哥哥 = 兄弟姐妹 → 近亲属. So yes.\n\nSo all four would be punishable: ABCD? Hmm. That's possible but let me scrutinize A once more.\n\nA: \"无正当理由，不接受某体育福利彩票中心对公证事项的委托\"\n\nRule 12(1): \"无正当理由，不接受指定的公益性公证事项的\" — the trigger is refusing a \"指定的公益性公证事项\" (designated public-interest notarization matter). The question says the lottery center 委托 (entrusts) the notarization matter. Is that \"指定\"? The委托 comes from the party (lottery center), not from a designation by the司法行政机关/公证机构. Hmm.\n\nBut note the phrase \"某体育福利彩票中心\" — this smells like a classic textbook example: 体育彩票/福利彩票开奖公证 is a公益性公证事项 which the公证机构 is指定 to supervise. Actually, I recall from《公证与律师制度》 textbooks: \"公证员不得无正当理由拒绝受理公证\" and \"对于公益性的公证事项(如开奖公证)不得拒绝\".\n\nHmm. Also consider: maybe the intended reading is that accepting委托 is the notary's freedom — refusing a委托 is not a violation per se UNLESS it's a指定的公益性公证事项. The question says \"某体育福利彩票中心对公证事项的委托\" — a lottery center's开奖公证. Welfare lottery =公益性 (public welfare). The exam likely intends \"公益性公证事项\" → refusal without justification violates12(1) → 警告.\n\nHmm, alternatively — some answer keys for this question might be \"ABD\" with C excluded because a single negligence error doesn't warrant惩戒... or \"ABC\" with D excluded because... hmm.\n\nLet me think again about D's \"并按照规定收取了公证费用\" clause. Why would the question add this? Possible intended reasoning: \"丁为其哥嫂办理公证并按规定收费\" — the fact of collecting fees per rules is fine; but the issue is回避. OR the intended reasoning is: 丁 didn't do anything wrong — he charged per regulations, and哥嫂 are not his近亲属?? Hmm, actually — wait. Is 嫂 (sister-in-law, wife of elder brother) a 近亲属? No. Is 哥 (elder brother)? Yes. The agreement is \"哥嫂之间的婚前财产协议\" — both are parties. So the brother is a party. So the notary should have recused.\n\nHmm, but hold on — some analyses might say: \"丁为其哥嫂办理公证\" — the当事人 are 哥嫂, and 哥 is 丁的近亲属 → 违反回避规定 → 惩处. The \"按规定收费\" is irrelevant. So D is punishable.\n\nOK here's another thought about C. Let me reconsider: \"丙在2005年给当事人做的一次公证业务中，因个人的过失而出现错误\". Maybe the point:追诉时效 for惩戒 is 2 years? Hmm — I don't think the rules have that. But maybe the question is from a 2008+ exam and tests... no.\n\nAlternatively, maybe the point of2005 is this: 《公证员惩戒规则(试行)》 was adopted by中国公证员协会常务理事会 and effective 2004-04-01. In 2005, the error happened. There's no retroactivity issue. So C is punishable → 严重警告 (13(9)).\n\nHmm, unless... the exam is testing that惩戒 for错误公证文书 requires \"连续出现\" (consecutive occurrences) — a single isolated error doesn't meet \"连续出现2件以内\"? That seems like over-reading; \"2件以内\" clearly includes 1.\n\nHmm. Actually, hmm, wait. Let me re-read 13(9): \"一年内连续出现2件以内错误公证文书的\". Hmm — could this actually be \"一年内连续出现2件以上错误公证文书的\"? If the true text were \"2件以上\", then a single error (1件) would NOT be punishable, and C would be excluded! Let me verify the original text from another source. This is critical.\n\nThe two sources I have both say \"2件以内\". The eol.cn 司法考试复习知识点 says \"(9)一年内连续出现2件以内错误公证文书的\". The hzgzc full text says \"（九）一年内连续出现2件以内错误公证文书的\". And 14(1) \"3件以上5件以下\". Hmm, if 13(9) were \"2件以内\", then the tiers would be: 1-2件 → 严重警告; 3-5件 → 记过; 6件以上 → 暂停会员资格. That's a coherent tiered structure! 13(9) \"2件以内\" = 1-2 documents. So a single error → 严重警告. That fits the structure perfectly. Great, so C is punishable.\n\nWait, but \"连续出现2件以内\" is weird phrasing for \"1-2件\". Whatever — the tiered structure (1-2, 3-5, 6+) confirms.\n\nHmm OK so now, what about A? Let me think about whether \"委托\" vs \"指定\" matters. Actually, let me look at the question again: \"公证员甲无正当理由，不接受某体育福利彩票中心对公证事项的委托\". \n\nThe rule 12(1) covers \"不接受指定的公益性公证事项\". 彩票开奖公证 — under《彩票管理条例》(2009) or earlier《福利彩票管理暂行办法》, 开奖应当公证. So it's a公益性公证事项. The exam intent: A violates → 警告.\n\nActually, hmm, but here's a counter-thought: In some textbook Q&A, I've seen: \"公证员无正当理由，不接受当事人委托的, 是否应受惩戒?\" — Answer: 公证员对符合条件的公证事项应当受理, 无正当理由拒绝受理的属于违规. Actually 13(2) covers \"对应当受理的公证事项，无故推诿不予受理的\". A notarization required by law (开奖公证 must be notarized) is a matter that应当受理. So A is punishable either way.\n\nI'm fairly confident A is intended as a violation. Actually, wait — hmm, one more consideration. Let me reconsider: \"不接受某体育福利彩票中心对公证事项的委托\" — maybe the trick:公证 is based on申请/委托, and a notary can refuse if outside his业务范围... but \"无正当理由\" excludes that. Without justification, refusing to accept the lottery's commission =12(1) (公益性) or 13(2) (推诿不予受理). Punishable.\n\nSo all four are punishable? Hmm, that makes the question \"ABCD\". It's possible, but exam questions usually have at least one distractor. Let me look at each once more for hidden traps:\n\nA: \"无正当理由，不接受...\" — the rule says \"不接受指定的公益性公证事项\". The question says \"委托\" — not \"指定\". Hmm. Is a彩票开奖公证 \"指定\" or \"委托\"? Hmm. Actually, hmm, in real practice: 彩票发行机构 (lottery center) applies to the公证处 for开奖现场监督公证 — it's an application/委托 by the party. The公证处 accepts. Whether it's \"指定\" depends on whether the司法局 assigns it.\n\nHmm, the more I think: the exam is likely from《公证与律师制度》自考. Let me try to find the exact question in zikao banks. Let me search with distinctive phrases.\n\nAlso, maybe I should reconsider B: \"乙在公证员名片上印有曾经担任过的行政职务、专业技术职务\" — 12(5) literally lists \"在公证员名片上印有曾担任过的行政职务、荣誉职务、专业技术职务或者其他头衔的\" → 警告. B is exactly this (行政职务、专业技术职务). Clearly punishable. B correct.\n\nC: single negligence error in 2005. Hmm, wait — one more consideration! \"因个人的过失而出现错误\" — maybe the notarization was erroneous due to negligence. Under 13(9), 1-2 erroneous documents within a year → 严重警告. But hold on — \"2005年\" and the question might have been asked in e.g. 2009, testing \"追诉时效\" — hmm, there IS no时效 in the rules. But wait — maybe the question intends: the惩戒规则 came into force 2004年4月1日, and the error was in 2005 — so it applies. If they wanted it excluded, they'd say 2003. So C is included. Hmm.\n\nAlternatively — maybe the question is from a specific exam whose official answer I should find. Let me try more searches with different phrasings.\n\nActually, let me think about what \"2005年\" could exclude. Hmm! Maybe the point is: 《公证法》 was enacted in 2005 (August 28, 2005), effective March 1, 2006. And 《公证员惩戒规则(试行)》 based on 《公证暂行条例》. Hmm, not obviously relevant.\n\nOR maybe: the question is from 2006-2007 and \"2005年\" is just flavor for \"a past business\". The test point: one erroneous document due to negligence → falls under 13(9) → 严重警告. So C is punishable.\n\nHmm OK, and D: Let me reconsider whether the exam might exclude D. \"丁为其哥嫂之间的婚前财产协议办理了公证，并按照规定收取了公证费用\" — the trap could be:公证员 can notarize for relatives as long as... no, prohibited. Or the trap: 婚前财产协议公证 — is that within公证业务范围? Yes,婚前财产约定协议公证 is a common item. And哥嫂 =丁的哥哥和嫂子 →兄 is近亲属 → 回避. So punishable.\n\nHmm, so the answer could be ABCD. But wait — let me reconsider D's fee clause once more: \"并按照规定收取了公证费用\". Maybe the intended reading: \"丁...办理了公证，并按照规定收取了公证费用\" — nothing wrong with fees. But the relationship issue → violation of回避 → punishable. So D is included. The fee clause is there to test whether students get distracted by fee rules.\n\nAlternatively — maybe the exam answer is \"AB\" only, with C and D excluded:\n- C excluded because \"因个人的过失而出现错误\" once → \"情节显著轻微\" → 批评教育, not惩戒? But 13(9) contradicts... unless 13(9) requires \"连续出现2件以上\". Hmm.\n\nHmm, actually, let me re-examine 13(9) once more. If the true text is \"一年内连续出现2件以内错误公证文书的\" then 1件 → 严重警告. But would the drafters really give严重警告 for a single error? Looking at the tier: 13(9) covers \"2件以内\" = at most 2; 14(1) covers \"3件以上5件以下\"; 15(3) covers \"6件以上\". So yes: 1-2 → 严重警告; 3-5 → 记过; 6+ → 暂停. Single error → 严重警告. That's consistent.\n\nBut hmm, \"连续出现2件以内\" — if only one error occurred in a year, is that \"连续出现\"? \"2件以内\" explicitly contemplates 1件 or 2件. So yes.\n\nOK, but actually — is C's \"错误\" necessarily a \"错误公证文书\"? \"在2005年给当事人做的一次公证业务中，因个人的过失而出现错误\" — an error occurred in the notarization business = the notarization document was erroneous. I'd say yes.\n\nHmm, wait. Actually, maybe C's trap is different: \"因个人的过失而出现错误\" — the punishment for错误公证文书 is based on count within a year. ONE error = \"2件以内\" → 严重警告. So punishable. The \"2005年\" is to fix the year for the \"一年内\" count. OK.\n\nSo my analysis says all four are punishable → ABCD.\n\nHmm, but let me reconsider A once more. Actually, I want to find the source of this question. It looks like it could be from司法考试 2005 or 2006 (卷一 法律职业道德). Let me search for \"无正当理由，不接受\" \"彩票\" 司法考试.\n\nActually, let me think about the phrase \"体育福利彩票\" — this is a weird term; real term is \"福利彩票\" or \"体育彩票\". \"某体育福利彩票中心\" merges them. This looks like a question crafted from the rule's \"公益性公证事项\" concept — 体育彩票/福利彩票开奖公证 is the classic example of公益性公证事项 in textbooks.\n\nI recall a textbook statement: \"公证员无正当理由，不得拒绝接受当事人的公证申请; 对于公益性的公证事项(如开奖、招投标等),必须接受\". Hmm.\n\nLet me do one more search to find the original question with answer. Try Baidu-ish queries via brave.", "thinkingSignature": "reasoning_content"}, {"type": "text", "text": "Let me verify the exact text of Article 13(9) and look for this question in exam banks."}, {"type": "toolCall", "id": "call_e462b7eea48f44e1ae204b8b", "name": "web_search", "arguments": {"query": "\"一年内连续出现2件\" 错误公证文书 严重警告 公证员惩戒规则"}}, {"type": "toolCall", "id": "call_edff35d8958b495a9702f31f", "name": "web_search", "arguments": {"query": "公证员 \"婚前财产协议\" \"哥嫂\" 回避 惩戒规则 试题 多选"}}], "api": "openai-completions", "provider": "xiaomi-tp", "model": "mimo-v2.6-pro", "usage": {"input": 4630, "output": 8749, "cacheRead": 32768, "cacheWrite": 0, "totalTokens": 46147, "cost": {"input": 0, "output": 0, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0}}, "stopReason": "toolUse", "timestamp": 1791705171121, "responseId": "1c55b4bd-ed20-4e51-8db9-b41f242d905b_8788939ee8af4b3a88ecef6f9f33c9c5"}}
