12748, "externalContent": {"untrusted": true, "source": "web_search", "provider": "brave", "wrapped": true}, "results": [{"title": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"3c6b0db84472669c\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\n公证员惩戒规则（试行）_广东省广州市海珠公证处\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"3c6b0db84472669c\">>>", "url": "http://www.hzgzc.com/sfjs/18", "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"e9a6058b20e09852\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\n公证员有下列行为之一的... （一）<strong>一年内连续出现3件以上5件以下错误公证文书的； （二）违反公证法规、规章规定的； （三）违反公证管辖办理公证的； （四）违反职业道德和执业纪律，拒不改正的； （五）受到严重警告惩戒后，6个月内又有第十三条所列行为的；</strong> ...\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"e9a6058b20e09852\">>>", "published": "May 16, 2015", "siteName": "www.hzgzc.com"}, {"title": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"53bf59f42e26745e\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\n公证员惩戒的种类和适用条件 - 遗产继承律师\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"53bf59f42e26745e\">>>", "url": "http://www.govwq.com/show-m.asp?id=4015", "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"f28fe5c6a68ad609\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\n5．《公证员惩戒规则(试行)》第15条规定，公证员有下列行为之一的，予以暂停公证员协会会员资格，并建议司法行政机关给予暂停执业的行政处罚：(1)利用职务之便牟取或收受不当利益的；(2)违反职业道德和执业纪律，情节严重的；(3)一年内连续出现6件以上错误公证文书的；(4)受到记过惩戒后，6个月内又有第14条所列行为的；(5)其他损害公证行业利益的行为，后果严重的。暂停会员资格期限为3个月至12个月。\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"f28fe5c6a68ad609\">>>", "siteName": "www.govwq.com"}, {"title": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"541be780457f2418\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\n公证执业违规行为惩戒规则（试行）_规范性文件_公证业务_北京市公证协会官方网站\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"541be780457f2418\">>>", "url": "https://www.chinabjnotary.org.cn/content/details_17_67059.html", "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"5075a3081a55f735\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\n北京市公证协会举办文书鉴定基本问题及标准解读培训（“京司证学大讲堂”第十三期） · 北京市公证协会开展2026年第二期公证员职前培训面试考核\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"5075a3081a55f735\">>>", "siteName": "www.chinabjnotary.org.cn"}, {"title": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"20d734a327a4de28\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\n“公证”错误的七条救济途径\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"20d734a327a4de28\">>>", "url": "https://www.kangdalawyers.com/newsdetail_2431.html", "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"b116d31b26a17a36\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\n北京 西安 深圳 海口 上海 广州 杭州 沈阳 南京 天津 菏泽 成都 苏州 呼和浩特 香港 武汉 郑州 长沙 厦门 重庆 合肥 宁波 济南 昆明 南昌 · 公证文书，是一种具有特殊效力的法律文书。普通的公证文书，法院可直接采信其...\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"b116d31b26a17a36\">>>", "siteName": "www.kangdalawyers.com"}, {"title": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"b3bae2b3f283f812\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\n中华人民共和国公证法 - 中华人民共和国最高人民法院公报\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"b3bae2b3f283f812\">>>", "url": "http://gongbao.court.gov.cn/Details/80d8da460dc799022988a6cf16c50f.html", "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"9ad8ee7c3eaee604\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\n第一条 为规范公证活动，保障公证机构和公证员依法履行职责，预防纠纷，保障自然人、法人或者其他组织的合法权益，制定本法。 · 第二条 公证是公证机构根据自然人、法人或者其他组织的申请，依照法定程序对民事法律行为、有法律意义的事实和文书的真实性、合法性予以证明的活动。\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"9ad8ee7c3eaee604\">>>", "siteName": "gongbao.court.gov.cn"}]}, "isError": false, "timestamp": 1791705295412}}
{"type": "message", "id": "da490cc6", "parentId": "741a1d74", "timestamp": "2026-10-11T07:55:43.185Z", "message": {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "The tiering is confirmed: 13(9): 一年内连续出现2件以内错误公证文书 → 严重警告; 14(1): 3-5件 → 记过; 15(3): 6件以上 → 暂停会员资格.\n\nSo a single erroneous document in one year (C) → 严重警告 → punishable.\n\nNow let me think really carefully about the intended answer. This question format (\"下列情形中...应当受到惩处的有\") with 4 options — from an exam like 自考《公证与律师制度》 or 法考.\n\nLet me analyze each option once more against the rules:\n\nA: 公证员甲无正当理由，不接受某体育福利彩票中心对公证事项的委托\n→ 12(1) \"无正当理由，不接受指定的公益性公证事项的\" —福利彩票开奖公证属于公益性公证事项. Punishable (警告). ✓\n\nHmm, but \"委托\" vs \"指定\". Ugh. Let me think about how these exam questions are usually written. If the exam wanted to test 12(1) precisely, it would say \"无正当理由，不接受指定的公益性公证事项(如福利彩票开奖公证)\". The question says \"不接受某体育福利彩票中心对公证事项的委托\" — i.e., refusing the lottery center's commission. The design: student must recognize that lottery开奖公证 is公益性 and the notary cannot refuse without justification. I'll count A as punishable.\n\nAlternatively — the design could be the opposite: 12(1) covers only \"指定的公益性公证事项\"; here it's a party's委托, not a designation; and公证 is based on申请 (voluntary), so refusing a委托 is not punishable. Hmm. But then13(2) \"对应当受理的公证事项，无故推诿不予受理的\" would still catch it if the matter \"应当受理\".\n\nActually wait — hmm, \"无故推诿不予受理\" (deliberately delaying/pushing away and refusing to accept) vs \"不接受委托\" (not accepting the commission). Both are refusal to accept matters that should be accepted. The question deliberately says \"无正当理由\" which maps to both 12(1) (\"无正当理由\") and 13(2) (\"无故推诿\").\n\nI think A is intended as a violation. Also the phrase \"体育福利彩票\" signals 公益性.\n\nB: 名片印有曾担任过的行政职务、专业技术职务 → 12(5) verbatim. Punishable. ✓\n\nC: 一次公证业务中因个人过失出现错误 (2005) → 13(9) \"一年内连续出现2件以内错误公证文书的\" (1件) → 严重警告. Punishable. ✓\n - The \"2005年\" confirms it's within the rule's validity (effective 2004-04-01).\n\nD: 丁为其哥嫂之间的婚前财产协议办理了公证，并按照规定收取了公证费用\n→ 13(6) \"违反回避规定的\" → 严重警告. 哥 (elder brother) is 丁的近亲属 and is a party to the agreement; 丁 should have recused. Punishable. ✓\n   - \"按照规定收取了公证费用\" is a red herring; fee compliance doesn't cure the回避 violation.\n\nSo the answer = ABCD.\n\nHmm, wait. But is it plausible that the exam answer is ABCD? Let me reconsider option C once more — \"因个人的过失而出现错误\". Could the exam intend \"错误公证文书\" to require the公证书 to be wrong, and here merely \"出现错误\" in the business (e.g., a mistake corrected before issuance)? The phrase \"给当事人做的一次公证业务中，因个人的过失而出现错误\" is vague. But standard interpretation: 出现错误公证文书. Hmm.\n\nAlso, is there a possibility that C is excluded due to 追诉时效? Some industry rules (e.g., 律师执业行为规范) have 2-year时效? Hmm. Actually, let me think — the question emphasizes \"在2005年\". If the exam were given in 2005-2006, \"2005年\" would be \"this year\". If the exam were later... The question seems to come from around 2005-2007 (since it references the试行 rules which were replaced by《公证执业违规行为惩戒规则(试行)》 in 2018).\n\nHmm, actually! Maybe the \"2005年\" is significant for a different reason: the question might have been written in 2004 or early 2005 in a context where... no.\n\nOR maybe the \"2005年\" hints at the 一年内 count period: if the exam is in a later year, the \"一年内\" window has passed — but惩戒 isn't limited to the current year; 13(9) just means errors within a one-year period. So still punishable.\n\nAlternatively, C's trap: \"因个人的过失\" — meaning NOT intentional. 16(2) \"故意出具错误公证书的\" → 取消会员资格. So a negligent error doesn't reach that level, but 13(9) still applies → 严重警告. So punishable.\n\nOK, and let me reconsider D's trap: \"按照规定收取了公证费用\" — if a notary notarizes for relatives AND charges fees... hmm. Is there any rule that a notary may notarize for relatives if he charges fees? No — the prohibition is absolute (回避). So D is punishable.\n\nHmm, but actually wait. Let me reconsider whether 哥嫂之间的婚前财产协议 involves the brother as a party... \"哥嫂之间的婚前财产协议\" = prenuptial property agreement between brother and (future) sister-in-law. Parties: 哥 and 嫂. 丁's哥哥 is a party. 丁 is 兄弟 of the party → 近亲属 → must回避. Yes.\n\nBut hmm, one could argue:婚前财产协议 is signed BEFORE marriage, so at the time \"嫂\" is the brother's fiancée, not yet 嫂. Whatever — the brother is the party regardless.\n\nSo D → violation of回避 → punishable.\n\nTherefore answer: ABCD.\n\nHmm, but hold on. Let me reconsider A ONE more time. This is the one I'm least sure about. Key:12(1) requires the matter to be \"指定的公益性公证事项\". The option says the lottery center 委托 the notary with a公证事项. The concept \"委托\" — in 公证 practice, parties apply (申请) to the公证处, and the公证处 handles it. The phrase \"对公证事项的委托\" — the lottery center entrusts the notarization of e.g., 开奖活动 to the notary.\n\nTextbook (公证与律师制度, 全国自考教材): I recall a section on公证员的职业道德 and执业纪律 with a list of禁止行为. Hmm.\n\nActually, you know what — I recall this exact question might be from the 2007年司法考试卷一 (法律职业道德部分). 司法考试 questions on 公证 are rare but exist (e.g., 2007卷一第49题?). Hmm. Actually there was a 2007 question: \"下列哪一选项属于公证员职业道德...\" hmm.\n\nLet me try one more search for the question source with key phrases.", "thinkingSignature": "reasoning_content"}, {"type": "toolCall", "id": "call_2393c812ee9f4a13b657382f", "name": "web_search", "arguments": {"query": "\"不接受某体育福利彩票中心\" OR \"哥嫂之间的婚前财产协议\" 公证 惩处"}}], "api": "openai-completions", "provider": "xiaomi-tp", "model": "mimo-v2.6-pro", "usage": {"input": 1648, "output": 3343, "cacheRead": 41856, "cacheWrite": 0, "totalTokens": 46847, "cost": {"input": 0, "output": 0, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0}}, "stopReason": "toolUse", "timestamp": 1791705295424, "responseId": "62c35d5f-2631-4875-9818-9f2fc8516b8c_bbb9082529e6486b9de45b4ee4b03e97"}}
